### Initial fake balances
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts

### Create a transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: invoice-1042

{"fromAccount":"ACC-1001","toAccount":"ACC-1002","amount":25.00}

### Repeat same request (no second debit)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: invoice-1042

{"fromAccount":"ACC-1001","toAccount":"ACC-1002","amount":25.00}

### Same key with changed amount (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: invoice-1042

{"fromAccount":"ACC-1001","toAccount":"ACC-1002","amount":27.00}
